 61CU c  Two-proton transfer experiment.                                        
 61CU c  2014Pa50: E({+3}He)=22.5 MeV from iThemba Labs Separated Sector        
 61CU2c  cyclotron facility. Target=9.6 mg/cm{+2} thick. Gamma rays were        
 61CU3c  detected using AFRODITE array of nine BGO-shielded Clover HPGe         
 61CU4c  detectors, five at 90|' and four at 135|' with respect to the beam     
 61CU5c  direction. Neutron detector consisted of an array of nine large-volume 
 61CU6c  NE102A plastic scintillators, placed symmetrically about |q(lab)=0|'   
 61CU7c  and 90|' to the beam direction. Measured E|g, n|g-coin. Deduced        
 61CU8c  population strengths of L=0, 7/2- states and compared to shell model   
 61CU9c  and reaction cross section model calculations.                         
